    "title": "New Voice Actors for Harry Potter Audiobook",
    "text": "• Young British actors Frankie Treadaway, Arabella Stanton, and Max Lester are voicing Harry Potter characters.\n• The characters include Harry Potter, Hermione Granger, and Ron Weasley.\n• The audiobook is produced by Audible.\n• Each character is voiced by a different actor instead of a single narrator.\n• The actors expressed enjoyment in voice acting and being part of the Harry Potter universe.\n• They mentioned having a snack cupboard and fridge filled with chocolate during recording sessions.\n• The audiobook of 'Harry Potter and the Sorcerer's Stone' is set to release on November 4.",
